{"output":"I’ll inspect the search code and existing tests, add a focused stale-request guard, and run the tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nThe file lookup didn’t support the combined pattern. I’ll use a simple listing to locate the code and tests.\n\nThe controller lets every completed request update state. I added a search ID guard to results, errors, and loading updates; clearing the query also invalidates pending requests. The existing tests cover normal behavior, so I’ll run those plus an in-memory race-condition check.\n\nFixed src/search/controller.ts so only the latest search updates results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; node --input-type=module race probe passed; git diff --check passed. Combined command exited 0.\n\nNo tests modified, dependencies installed, or blockers.","final_output":"Fixed src/search/controller.ts so only the latest search updates results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; node --input-type=module race probe passed; git diff --check passed. Combined command exited 0.\n\nNo tests modified, dependencies installed, or blockers.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":11,"tool_calls":[{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-m_m99ddq/2-1-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":194,"stdout_bytes":135,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-82a8611e80b9fe59563d60524b4782bb.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test\nnode --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst requests = [];\nconst c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => requests.push({ resolve, reject })) });\nconst items = [{ id: 'new', title: 'New', url: '/new' }];\nfor (const fail of [false, true]) {\n  const old = c.search('old');\n  const current = c.search('current');\n  const before = c.getState();\n  const [a, b] = requests.splice(0);\n  fail ? a.reject(new Error('stale')) : a.resolve([]);\n  await old;\n  assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), before);\n  b.resolve(items);\n  await current;\n  assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: 'current', results: items, loading: false, error: null });\n}\nconst old = c.search('old');\nconst current = c.search('current');\nconst [a, b] = requests.splice(0);\nb.resolve(items);\nawait current;\na.resolve([]);\nawait old;\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState().results, items);\nfor (const fail of [false, true]) {\n  const pending = c.search('pending');\n  const [request] = requests.splice(0);\n  void c.search('  ');\n  const cleared = { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null };\n  assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), cleared);\n  fail ? request.reject(new Error('stale')) : request.resolve(items);\n  await pending;\n  assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), cleared);\n}\nconsole.log('Race-condition probe passed');\nNODE\n git diff --check; git diff -- src/search/controller.ts; git status --short","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-m_m99ddq/2-1-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":365,"stdout_bytes":2167,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-c76b4c88c5a76b11d85cccc8acbb2de0.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":38180,"output_tokens":1109},"usage_details":{"cached_input_tokens":12160,"cache_write_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":15}}
